# a U-cup (open upward): the canonical CONCAVE collider fixture. The interior
# x in [-1,1], y in [-0.5,1.5] is OUTSIDE the solid - a ball drops into it and
# settles on the inner floor (y=-0.5), a spot a box approximation cannot reach.
version 3
fill 0.40 0.70 0.90 1.0
contour 8
v -2 -1.5
v 2 -1.5
v 2 1.5
v 1 1.5
v 1 -0.5
v -1 -0.5
v -1 1.5
v -2 1.5
